{"agent":"n3-kilo","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`launch_env` returns `{}` whenever `api_key_file` is set, even if `api_key_env` is also set. `secret_env` still resolves “variable first, then key file” and snapshots that value at prepare time. Given `api_key_env=\"GEMINI_API_KEY\"` (set) and `api_key_file` pointing at a key file, prepare injects the env value via `secret_env` and passes an empty `LaunchSpec.env`. Unset `GEMINI_API_KEY` before launch and the launcher does not refuse, so the child runs on the stale snapshot. The live-source map should follow the source that actually supplied the key (variable currently set), not the mere presence of a file path.","digest":"f18d75207514d0cb","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/lanes/endpoint.py:launch_env","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/lanes/endpoint.py:launch_env"}],"chunks_total":3,"coverage":"3/3 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":17728,"diff_sha":"3f88e4a4ce07306c43bb2eef5ccd2615ed07be0f9470ac1aa67a33f315c61b1d","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B26c3e73d84","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":67.8,"excluded_bytes":1956160,"excluded_files":1,"excluded_paths":["tests/test_uc_surf_setup_ops_transcript.json"],"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"ac5eb08986ecac3a","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B26c3e73d84.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261111T043140Z-e9b89c2c.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794371500.0207422,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}],"review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3],"reviewed_head":"0ba7d340ffbb773ff6c22b04c48c9de6de95d614","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/adapters/fakes/templates.py":"100644 a92b3237535e43370e58ac7173f6aafc408c3cc6